## 8. Self-Healing Patterns

### Automatic Test Fixes
```typescript
// Floor detects common test issues and suggests fixes:

// Issue: TypeError: Cannot read property 'status' of undefined
// Fix: Add null check or proper mock

// Issue: Timeout in test suite
// Fix: Increase timeout or add explicit timeout promise

// Issue: D1 query type error
// Fix: Add proper type cast with interface
```

### Circuit Breaker Integration
```typescript
// Auto-halts deployment if critical metrics fail:
if (errorRate > 0.05) {
  console.error('❌ Error rate > 5%, halting deployment');
  process.exit(1);
}

if (testPassRate < 0.80) {
  console.error('❌ Test pass rate < 80%, halting deployment');
  process.exit(1);
}

if (coverage < 0.81) {
  console.error('❌ Coverage < 81%, halting deployment');
  process.exit(1);
}
```

